OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is Blackpool such a Strictly  
OL,4,Ahighlight?                             
OL,6,FFrom Halloween high kicks to magical   
OL,7,FMovie Week moves, Strictly Come        
OL,8,FDancing's highlights can often come    
OL,9,Fthick and fast, but once a season,     
OL,10,Fthere is a particular peculiarity that 
OL,11,Fhas become a much-loved tradition - the
OL,12,Fannual decamp to Blackpool.            
OL,14,FThe seaside resort was a location in   
OL,15,Fthe first series of the BBC programme  
OL,16,Fback in 2004 and went on to become a   
OL,17,Fmainstay moment.                       
OL,19,FThe show returns to the town on        
OL,20,FSaturday and will see eight couples    
OL,21,Ftaking to the dancefloor in the        
OL,22,Fmagnificent Blackpool Tower Ballroom.  
